---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Insights on AI visibility, generative search, and building the infrastructure that makes AI recommend your brand.
canonical: https://vewo.ai/blog/
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<section class="section">
 <div class="container">
  <header class="sec-head reveal">
   <span class="kicker">VEWO Blog</span>
   <h2>Insights for the<br /><span class="grad">AI discovery era.</span></h2>
   <p class="sec-sub">How AI is reshaping discovery, and what it takes to be the brand it recommends.</p>
  </header>

  {% if collections.posts.length %}
  <div class="blog-grid">
   {% for post in collections.posts %}
   <a class="blog-card reveal" href="{{ post.url }}">
    {% if post.data.tags and post.data.tags[1] %}<span class="blog-card__tag">{{ post.data.tags[1] }}</span>{% endif %}
    <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
    <p class="blog-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <p class="blog-card__meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
    <span class="blog-card__more">Read more →</span>
   </a>
   {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="blog-empty reveal">New posts coming soon.</p>
  {% endif %}
 </div>
</section>
